   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultant RBM Liberia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Consultant RBM Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med RBM konsulten &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka RBM inom Liberias landprogram. Konsulten kommer att arbeta med Ambassadens handl&#xe4;ggare samt Sidas samarbetspartner, Konsulten kommer att bed&#xf6;ma behoven f&#xf6;r RBM och genom workshops och mentorprocessen, utveckla samarbetspartners kapaciteten och &#xf6;ka deras f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;elsen f&#xf6;r RBM.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the RBM Consultant is to strengthen results based management within country programme. Working with Programme Officers and cooperation partners, the Consultant will assess the needs for RBM and through workshop and mentoring process, develop capacity and increase understanding of RBM.</narrative>
  </description>
